prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
prompt
key esc
# March 1870, Washington taken: the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: a name.
play until 14:O
state
text q
play until 11
text Grant
key enter
# Game 3. Start NEW Game; UTILITY, End Cond: Cities, Income, Capital and Force Ratio off.
play until 14:C
digest
text s
play until 14:M
digest
text u
